  "description": "The record Fleet leaves on a System for each Application, Service, or Backup Job it installs there (ADR-0010). Beyond this schema, Heimdall refuses a health URL port above 65535 and a Backup Job scheduled twice at one time. Fleet writes no field this schema does not name; a Collector reading a newer version of it drops the fields it does not know.",
  "title": "Heimdall install record v1"
}
